    "detailed_description": "Overview of the game:<br />\r\nGetting lost and completing puzzles to continue on the path. With roguelike elements mixed in with horror and storytelling.  If you are into speed running through games there is a mode for you! Lost Memories has a lot to offer for all players to enjoy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay features: <br />\r\nAn action horror game where are you running hide and solve puzzles. <br />\r\nFear system: if you aren\u2019t in a building or around a campfire, you will start the game fear which will make your vision, cloudy, and your movement slower. <br />\r\nWeapons: there is one single weapon that can disable the enemies movement if you can find it. <br />\r\nFlashlight: the flashlight is used for finding your way through Lost memories. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhy I made this game:<br />\r\nI made this game for the players to experience a simple roguelike horror game with passionate storytelling.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat this game expresses:<br />\r\nI want Lost Memories to have the players feel like no matter the memory no matter how long it has been since the memory. It will never be lost. I hope everyone enjoys my game and can find peace when they play and challenge themselves.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContent:<br />\r\nBeing early but ready for the public. I wanted the game to be released so they can experience the single-player mode. I have a multiplayer mode in mind that will be released at a later time.",
    "about_the_game": "Overview of the game:<br />\r\nGetting lost and completing puzzles to continue on the path. With roguelike elements mixed in with horror and storytelling.  If you are into speed running through games there is a mode for you! Lost Memories has a lot to offer for all players to enjoy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay features: <br />\r\nAn action horror game where are you running hide and solve puzzles. <br />\r\nFear system: if you aren\u2019t in a building or around a campfire, you will start the game fear which will make your vision, cloudy, and your movement slower. <br />\r\nWeapons: there is one single weapon that can disable the enemies movement if you can find it. <br />\r\nFlashlight: the flashlight is used for finding your way through Lost memories. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhy I made this game:<br />\r\nI made this game for the players to experience a simple roguelike horror game with passionate storytelling.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat this game expresses:<br />\r\nI want Lost Memories to have the players feel like no matter the memory no matter how long it has been since the memory. It will never be lost. I hope everyone enjoys my game and can find peace when they play and challenge themselves.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContent:<br />\r\nBeing early but ready for the public. I wanted the game to be released so they can experience the single-player mode. I have a multiplayer mode in mind that will be released at a later time.",
